{
  "name": "ATS Job Delta Monitor - Workday, Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ATS job delta monitor\n\n1. Create a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` (token at console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Select it in **Run Actor (changes only)**.\n3. Edit `targets` in the request body: Workday, Greenhouse, Lever or Ashby career-site URLs.\n4. Connect the three outputs to Slack, email or Google Sheets.\n\nThe first run returns every current job as ADDED; later runs return only new, edited and closed jobs. Billing is pay-per-event on Apify (see the Actor's Pricing tab).",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "6f1d2a10-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 12
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "6f1d2a10-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Every 12 hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [480, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/ginugokz~ats-zero-browser-gateway/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"targets\": [\n    \"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/linear\",\n    \"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/ramp\"\n  ],\n  \"only_deltas\": true,\n  \"full_scan\": true,\n  \"include_details\": false\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 320000
        }
      },
      "id": "6f1d2a10-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Run Actor (changes only)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [720, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "6f1d2a10-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a1",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.delta_status }}",
                    "rightValue": "ADDED",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "New jobs"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "6f1d2a10-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a2",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.delta_status }}",
                    "rightValue": "REMOVED",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Closed jobs"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "6f1d2a10-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a3",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.delta_status }}",
                    "rightValue": "UPDATED",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Edited jobs"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6f1d2a10-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Route by change",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [960, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "6f1d2a10-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1",
              "name": "alert",
              "value": "=New job: {{ $json.title }} at {{ $json.company_tenant }} ({{ $json.source_system }}). Salary: {{ $json.compensation_raw || 'not published' }}. {{ $json.url }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6f1d2a10-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Format new job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1220, 220]
